:''Not to be confused with [[Lilith Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Lilith Cat]].''
'''Lilin''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals (Gacha Event)|Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals]] event. She was added in [[Version 10.8 Update|Version 10.8]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.8 Update|Version 11.8]] increases her health and gains [[Surge Attack]]s. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]].

