==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]], Her, [[Raclesa (Uber Rare Cat)|Raclesa]], [[Pegasa (Uber Rare Cat)|Pegasa]], [[Terun (Uber Rare Cat)|Terun]], and [[Jeanne (Legend Rare Cat)|Jeanne]]'s Evolved Forms were missing the ", type" part of their names that other Galaxy Gals had.
*In ancient Mesopotamian religion, ''lilin'' were a form of hostile night spirit that attacked men.
**In Jewish mythology, ''Lilin'' is a term for night spirits.
*Lilin, type π's design appears to take cues from [[wikipedia:Morrigan Aensland|Morrigan Aensland]], the female protagonist of Capcom's ''Darkstalkers'' series.
*Mateki in Japanese is 魔滴, which literally translates to "Demon Drop", but may also be a pun on 悪魔敵 ''Akuma Teki'' ("[[:Category:Aku Enemies|Devil Enemy]]").
*Divine Lilin π's description does not mention her ability to create [[Surge Attack]]s.

